# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2026-09-06 - khtpm/HQ per-app runtime scratch. These are written by a
# running app/manager every launch and every tick; they are never
# "work" and re-appear the moment an app runs. .gitignore stops the
# UNTRACKED ones from cluttering `git status`; the small set that was
# already committed is untracked in the same commit that adds this
# block (files stay on disk, `git rm --cached` only).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
**/module_parent.pid
**/*.pid
**/*_ui.txt
**/*_action.txt
**/*_buffer.txt
**/cli_io_state.txt
**/text_area_*.txt
**/.hq_manager/ui.txt
**/.hq_manager/label.txt
**/music_player_ui.txt
**/music_player_action.txt

# 2026-09-06 - more khtpm/HQ runtime scratch trees (pieces/* under the
# newer @.apps projects, piececraft-hq's per-session state dir).
**/102.agy-txt/pieces/
**/102.editor-*/pieces/
**/@.apps/piececraft-hq/state/

# house backup archives (large binaries — keep only on disk)
x0.parent-level-dev-env-04.04_*.7z

# 2026-09-09 SHARED-SOURCE-COMPILE-IN-PLACE.md — house-authored shared
# .c/.h are compiled in place from &.widgits/_shared-lib/ (via -I), never
# copied into a consumer ops/ dir. Ignore any stray build-copy so it
# can't be re-committed. (Path has an /ops/ segment, so the canonical
# _shared-lib/ copies are unaffected.)
**/ops/khtpm_css_parser.c
**/ops/khtpm_css_parser.h
**/ops/khtpm_render_core.c
**/ops/khtpm_draw_core.c

